Z||000021||Patrick's Dad||12-21-2001||12:10 PM||||You light up my life<BR>You give me hope<BR>To carry on<BR>You light up my day....<P><BR>Just kidding. Now you'll be hearing that song all day long because of me.<P>Seriously, though, it depends who I'm speaking to. My wife? Then it's "Vision of Love" by Mariah, our wedding song.<P>It took so long,<BR>Still I believed<BR>Somehow the one that I needed<BR>Would find me eventually.<BR>I had a vision of Love,<BR>And it was all that you've given me.<P>My son? "With Arms Wide Open" by Creed.<P>If I had just one wish,<BR>Only one demand.<BR>I hope he's not like me,<BR>I hope he understands,<BR>That he can take this life<BR>And hold it by the hand<BR>And he can greet the world<BR>With arms wide open.<P>My Daughter? "Butterfly Kisses" by Bob Carlisle.<P>There's two things I know for sure.<BR>She was sent here from heaven, and she's daddy's little girl.<BR>As I drop to my knees by her bed at night, she talks to Jesus, and I close my eyes.<BR>And I thank God for all the joy in my life,<BR>Oh, but most of all, for...<P>I don't really have a love song for my Formula....||||reg||12
